{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"kind","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Kind","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLNoteV4KindV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLNoteV4kindAC4KindVSgvp","role":"symbol","title":"kind"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlnote\/kind-swift.property"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote\/kind-swift.property"},"abstract":[{"text":"The graphic note type (e.g. quarter, eighth), if specified.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"kind"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Kind","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote\/Kind-swift.struct","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLNoteV4KindV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Maps to a nested MusicXML ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<type>"},{"text":" element.","type":"text"}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote"]]},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLNote":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlnote","title":"MXLNote","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLNote","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLNote","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Notes are the most common type of MusicXML data. The MusicXML format distinguishes between elements used for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sound information and elements used for notation information (e.g., tie is used for sound, tied for notation)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thus grace notes do not have a duration element. Cue notes have a duration element, as do forward elements,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"but no tie elements. Having these two types of information available can make interchange easier, as some","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"programs handle one type of information more readily than the other."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLNote/kind-swift.property":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlnote\/kind-swift.property","role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote\/kind-swift.property","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The graphic note type (e.g. quarter, eighth), if specified."}],"title":"kind","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"kind","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLNoteV4KindV","text":"Kind","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLNote/Kind-swift.struct":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlnote\/kind-swift.struct","title":"MXLNote.Kind","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Kind"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Kind"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The note-type type indicates the graphic note type. Values range from 1024th to maxima. The size attribute"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indicates full, cue, grace-cue, or large size. The default is full for regular notes, grace-cue for notes that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"contain both grace and cue elements, and cue for notes that contain either a cue or a grace element, but not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"both."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote\/Kind-swift.struct"}}}